      {
        "text": "Eva-Dina Delgado has represented the 3rd District since November 2019 and serves as Assistant Majority Leader. Before taking office, she was Vice President of Government and Community Relations at the Chicago Transit Authority and Chief of Staff to the President at Peoples Gas. She sponsored a $1.5 billion funding bill in 2025 to reform Chicago-area public transit. She was the chief House sponsor of a workplace privacy law. She also sponsored a law allowing the state treasurer to refinance student loans.",
